1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,781
Ye hai aapka FLOWRA Dashboard — aapke business ka homepage.

2
00:00:03,781 --> 00:00:09,038
Sabse upar aapko chaar cards dikhenge: Total Sales Total Orders Outstanding Amount

3
00:00:09,038 --> 00:00:10,438
aur Beat Coverage.

4
00:00:10,438 --> 00:00:16,143
Yeh charon numbers har 30 second mein automatic refresh hote hain — Tally ka latest data.

5
00:00:16,143 --> 00:00:19,220
Aap manually bhi Refresh button daba sakte hain.

6
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:23,899
Neeche What's New panel hai jab bhi FLOWRA mein koi naya feature aata hai

7
00:00:23,899 --> 00:00:25,299
yaha update dikhega.

8
00:00:25,299 --> 00:00:31,068
Aur bhi neeche aapko upcoming reminders, overdue customer digest, aur sync status dikhega.

9
00:00:31,068 --> 00:00:36,453
Upar navigation bar mein Sales CRM Inventory Analytics Salesman AI Reports CA Corner

10
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:38,760
har tab ek alag feature ke liye hai.

11
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:40,747
Right side mein FY selector hai

12
00:00:40,747 --> 00:00:45,235
usko change karke aap kisi bhi financial year ka data dekh sakte hain.

13
00:00:45,235 --> 00:00:45,576
Simple, na?
